HVSLSvWhYQ7kNvwECdHm-&_nc_oc=AdpsZ8JQhe4tm7845my-Q_vj-X2_99v3siAcSMGZCUzPj7mRqHieB5Lo_a5eMb5LN_E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCN8D5wGqY9mI0YDkz8uWWwPxrmesKiHB_BlppzdWARbA&oe=6A6B4E0D"}, "display_name": "Spatial TV", "keywords": ["Disney", "Video", "Max", "YouTube", "Hulu"], "long_description": "Spatial TV is the ultimate app to watch movies in VR. People love the amazing ambient light that transforms your home into a movie theater. \n\n**Dim your environment and immerse in the amazing lighting effect**\n{852842470242705}\n\n**Glow your screen**\n{871490895031711}\n\n**Supports YouTube, Disney+, HBO Max, Hulu, Apple TV+ and more**\n\nThere's also a built-in browser to access any video you love from the internet!\n\n{1152430492726135}\n\n**You will also love**\n\n- Optimized screen clarity with 3840 x 2160 super-sampled pixels per eye\n\n- Making the screen really huge and enjoying your favorite videos while lying back\n\n- Super flexible screen placement and intuitive design\n\n**Enjoy the breathtaking ambient light now!**\n\n{1150597832678777}\n\nNote: Netflix is not supported on Spatial TV yet\n", "short_description": "Spatial TV brings Real-time Lighting to your AR Movie experience\n\n- Lie down and enjoy your favorite video on a huge screen\n\n- Feel the magic of real-time screen lighting\n\n- Maximum sharpness with 3840 x 2160 super-sampled pixels\n\n- Supports YouTube, Plex, HBO Max, Hulu, Apple TV+, Disney+, Crunchyroll and more\n\n- Access any web-based content with the built-in browser \n\nNote: Netflix is not supported on Spatial TV yet\n\nFor support, please join our discord: https://discord.gg/G6J67kW2Vb"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spatial-tv.app/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Interdime", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spatial-tv.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags":